                                                "sense_id": "31f61a21-05c5-335b-a74e-133249f7bcb0",
                                                "text": "[…] does not know how to pick up the liquid from the cooker, and he asks someone else to use his rig to put his part in his rig."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
